                                "sense_id": "0054c33b-3efb-3779-b4d8-266d5416cb3f",
                                "text": "Can you have too much redox? Definitely."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f70ca217-2f3f-4190-80b0-6986c0e8f965",
                                "sense_id": "0054c33b-3efb-3779-b4d8-266d5416cb3f",
                                "text": "This will tell us whether redox is occurring, and if so, what is oxidized and reduced."
                            }
                        ]
